# Bakery Entrance and Cookbook Refinement

Status: DONE
Milestone: M8 Top-bound twelve-cake notebook published and verified live
Dependencies: 08_READABILITY_AND_SIMPLE_ORDERING.todo, 09_STORY_AND_CAKE_STICKERS.todo, 12_WHISK_AND_CRUMBS_BRAND.todo

## Purpose

Continue the existing uncommitted revision with a padded, viewport-scale bakery
entrance that waits for a click or keyboard activation, uses restrained parallax,
opens paired doors and tries a ringing bell from the entry gesture.
Strengthen the cookbook visual language around the real cake stickers, and keep
background outlines extremely dim behind reading copy while preserving their
normal subtle shade in open areas.
The later request adds a cover that turns from bottom to top around the top spiral,
with all twelve real cakes on one revealed sheet.

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve the current worktree and read the complete tracked diff before edits.
- [x] Keep the entrance skippable and absent without JavaScript.
- [x] Fill the viewport with the doorway while preserving generous responsive padding.
- [x] Add restrained pointer parallax before the visitor enters.
- [x] Open only after clicking anywhere or activating the entry link by keyboard.
- [x] Open paired bakery doors and animate the hanging bell without trapping focus.
- [x] Generate the bell locally with bounded Web Audio synthesis and no media file.
- [x] Never resume, unlock or replay audio blocked by browser policy.
- [x] Skip the entrance for reduced motion, forced colours, direct links, short
  screens, hidden tabs and preference changes.
- [x] Keep native entry and skip links when optional modules fail.
- [x] Frame the home and cake sections as lightly ruled cookbook pages.
- [x] Add layered paper edges, restrained depth and a small curled page corner.
- [x] Add optional fine-pointer tilt/lift that resets and respects reduced motion.
- [x] Preserve full transparent cake stickers rather than rectangular product cards.
- [x] Keep the normal subtle SVG pattern in open space.
- [x] Add near-solid cream/green local washes so patterns are extremely dim behind text.
- [x] Add captioned brand and cake-sticker images to README.md.
- [x] Run Node/build/browser entrance and full-site validation for this revision.
- [x] Inspect entrance frames and updated desktop/mobile pages in small image batches.
- [x] Publish the reviewed public files and record the exact release evidence.
- [x] Curate seven additional real cakes from the supplied export in small batches.
- [x] Prepare reviewed public photo and sticker derivatives without publishing the archive.
- [x] Add an accessible cover that turns from bottom to top around the top spiral.
- [x] Reveal all 12 cakes together on one physical notebook page.
- [x] Preserve direct gallery access for no JavaScript and reduced motion.
- [x] Validate the completed 12-cake page-turn revision locally.
- [x] Publish the notebook revision and verify the deployed page.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] The entrance cannot block core browsing, direct links, no-JavaScript use or
  reduced-motion/forced-colour users.
- [x] The visible doorway remains closed until intentional click/keyboard entry.
- [x] Pointer parallax is restrained and does not crop the sign or doors.
- [x] Audio starts only when the initial context is already running; a suspended,
  interrupted, closed or unsupported context remains silent and is released.
- [x] The bell voice is bounded, stops cleanly and releases its context.
- [x] Cookbook decoration does not shrink text, crop stickers or add new product claims.
- [x] Pattern opacity is locally suppressed around text instead of globally removed.
- [x] README images use repository assets and explanatory captions.
- [x] Current automated and browser checks pass.
- [x] Actual local visual inspection is recorded separately from public deployment.
- [x] Public deployment is recorded separately from local implementation evidence.
- [x] The bottom-corner target and native control both reveal the same 12-cake page.
- [x] Keyboard, reduced-motion and no-JavaScript paths expose the complete gallery.
- [x] All 12 records use verified real media and descriptive, non-invented labels.

